1:["$","$Ld",null,{"page":{"id":"library--dedicated-tl-youtube-account","kind":"library-article","route":"/roadmap/library/dedicated-tl-youtube-account","sourceUrl":"https://refold.la/roadmap/library/dedicated-tl-youtube-account","sourceHash":"1b651a387296b1015e8ecf53c04b80653dba01888838d1edde068371dd468ce0","collectedAt":"2026-09-01T16:52:46.430Z","bodyMode":"authorized-full-body","title":{"en":"Dedicated TL YouTube Account","zh":"目标语言专用 YouTube 账号"},"description":{"en":"","zh":""},"segments":[{"id":"segment-0001","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"One of the simplest ways to increase your immersion time is to create a separate YouTube account that you only use for your target language (TL). YouTube's recommendation algorithm is powerful — once it knows you watch TL content, it'll keep feeding you more.","zh":"增加沉浸时间最简单的方法之一，是创建一个只用于目标语言（TL）的独立 YouTube 账号。YouTube 的推荐算法非常强大——一旦它知道你会观看目标语言内容，就会不断为你推荐更多。"}},{"id":"how-to-set-it-up","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"How to Set It Up","zh":"如何设置"}},{"id":"segment-0003","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"You have two options for making a new account:","zh":"创建新账号有两种方式："}},{"id":"segment-0004","type":"list","ordered":true,"items":[{"en":"<strong>Create a new Google account</strong> with a new email address and everything","zh":"<strong>创建新的 Google 账号</strong>，包括新的电子邮箱地址等全套信息"},{"en":"<strong>Add a new YouTube channel</strong> to your existing account (depending on your account age, it may require verification from Google) <em>Since images display weird, scroll all the way down to the bottom of this page to see how to do this.</em>","zh":"<strong>在现有账号中添加新的 YouTube 频道</strong>（根据账号注册时长，Google 可能会要求验证）<em>由于图片显示不太正常，请一直滚动到本页最底部，查看具体操作方法。</em>"}]},{"id":"segment-0005","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Then, once you've gone through that setup, the process is:","zh":"完成上述设置后，请按以下步骤操作："}},{"id":"segment-0006","type":"list","ordered":true,"items":[{"en":"<strong>Set your location</strong> to a country that uses your TL (YouTube Settings → General → Location) <em>(this is OPTIONAL, but makes recommendations a little more relevant)</em>","zh":"<strong>将所在地设为</strong>使用你的目标语言的国家（YouTube 设置 → 常规 → 所在地）<em>（此项为可选设置，但能让推荐内容更相关一些）</em>"},{"en":"<strong>Change the language</strong> to your TL (YouTube Settings → General → Language) <em>(this is also OPTIONAL as it can change the language on all your accounts)</em>","zh":"<strong>将语言更改为</strong>你的目标语言（YouTube 设置 → 常规 → 语言）<em>（此项也是可选设置，因为它可能会更改你所有账号的语言）</em>"},{"en":"<strong>Train the algorithm:</strong> On the home page, click \"Not interested\" or \"Don't recommend this channel\" on any video that isn't in your TL. This teaches YouTube to stop suggesting native-language content.","zh":"<strong>训练算法：</strong>在首页上，遇到任何不是目标语言的视频，都点击“不感兴趣”或“不推荐此频道”。这样可以让 YouTube 学会停止推荐母语内容。"},{"en":"<strong>Search and subscribe</strong> to channels in your TL that match your interests","zh":"<strong>搜索并订阅</strong>符合你兴趣的目标语言频道"}]},{"id":"why-it-helps","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"Why It Helps","zh":"为什么它有帮助"}},{"id":"segment-0008","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"The biggest obstacle to immersion isn't willpower — it's your existing habits. When you open YouTube on your main account, you're immediately pulled toward familiar native-language content. A dedicated TL account removes that temptation entirely. Every recommendation, every trending video, every suggestion is in your target language.","zh":"沉浸最大的障碍不是意志力，而是你已有的习惯。在主账号中打开 YouTube 时，你会立刻被熟悉的母语内容吸引。目标语言专用账号可以彻底消除这种诱惑。每一项推荐、每一个热门视频、每一条建议都会使用你的目标语言。"}},{"id":"bonus-dedicated-immersion-devicebrowser","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"Bonus: Dedicated Immersion Device/Browser","zh":"额外建议：沉浸专用设备／浏览器"}},{"id":"segment-0010","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"If you want to take this further, consider having a tablet or phone that you only use for TL content. Set the device language to your TL, install TL apps and media, and keep it separate from your daily-use devices. This creates a physical boundary between your native-language world and your immersion world.","zh":"如果你想更进一步，可以考虑准备一台只用于目标语言内容的平板电脑或手机。将设备语言设置为目标语言，安装目标语言应用和媒体，并与日常使用的设备分开。这样，你的母语世界与沉浸世界之间就有了一道物理边界。"}},{"id":"segment-0011","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Open <a href=\"https://youtube.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://youtube.com</a> on your computer. Click on your account icon in the top right then:","zh":"在电脑上打开 <a href=\"https://youtube.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://youtube.com</a>。点击右上角的账号图标，然后："}}],"cards":[]},"siteBasePath":"/my_learning_docs"}]
